## 测试 3：直接探测 Driver Table

建议增加一个最小 C++ 诊断函数：

```cpp
struct DriverProbe
{
    std::string dynamicTypeName;
    std::string sourceTypeName;
    std::uintptr_t dynamicTypeAddress;
    std::uintptr_t sourceTypeAddress;
    bool driverFound;
};

DriverProbe ProbeIntegerDriver(
    const Handle(TDF_Attribute)& attr,
    const Handle(Message_Messenger)& messenger)
{
    Handle(BinMDF_ADriverTable) table =
        BinXCAFDrivers::AttributeDrivers(messenger);

    Handle(BinMDF_ADriver) driver;
    table->GetDriver(attr->DynamicType(), driver);

    DriverProbe out;
    out.dynamicTypeName = attr->DynamicType()->Name();
    out.dynamicTypeAddress =
        reinterpret_cast<std::uintptr_t>(attr->DynamicType().get());
    out.driverFound = !driver.IsNull();

    if (!driver.IsNull())
    {
        out.sourceTypeName = driver->SourceType()->Name();
        out.sourceTypeAddress =
            reinterpret_cast<std::uintptr_t>(driver->SourceType().get());
    }

    return out;
}
```

最关键的输出是：

```text
dynamicTypeName == sourceTypeName
dynamicTypeAddress 是否等于 sourceTypeAddress
driverFound 是否为 true
```

若名称相同但地址不同，基本坐实 RTTI/动态库身份分裂。

